Source tapes/theme.tape
Output work/take-b.mp4
Set Framerate 12
Hide
Type "source tapes/demo-env.zsh && clear" Enter
Sleep 1s
Show
Sleep 700ms
Type "claude"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 8s
Type "Use $mermail-email-e2e to test this app's signup and password-reset emails end to end and fix whatever is broken."
Sleep 1500ms
Enter
Sleep 12m
Screenshot work/take-b-end.png
